{"screen_name": "battan8", "file": "battan8", "name": "ばったん", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/903405878346440705/lKRHqcXf.jpg", "header_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/426578134/1716036171/1500x500", "description": "主に犬とまんが◆漫画の仕事のご依頼は現在お受けできません", "total_works": 44, "scraped_works": 30, "first_seen": "2026-03-05T21:51:50.481607+00:00", "last_updated": "2026-03-07T13:44:19.663333+00:00", "price_history": {"art": [{"amount": 25000, "recorded_at": "2026-03-05T21:51:50.481607+00:00"}, {"amount": 18000, "recorded_at": "2026-03-06T12:00:46.973891+00:00"}, {"amount": 15000, "recorded_at": "2026-03-07T01:57:54.270788+00:00"}, {"amount": 12000, "recorded_at": "2026-03-07T13:44:19.663333+00:00"}]}, "current_prices": {"art": 12000}, "price_range": {"art": {"min": 12000, "max": 25000}}, "links": [{"label": "Twitter", "url": "https://x.com/battan8", "name": "battan8"}, {"label": "Website", "url": "https://ngc6826.booth.pm", "name": ""}, {"label": "Fanbox", "url": "https://battan8.fanbox.cc", "name": "battan8"}], "flags": {}, "works": [{"path": "/@battan8/works/44", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/f0da77a8/uploads/origins/ad208ee1-921b-4bd4-a836-511cd9faff2c?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=22251c132d0475eceb1cd8d94c466305", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/f0da77a8/uploads/origins/ad208ee1-921b-4bd4-a836-511cd9faff2c?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=22251c132d0475eceb1cd8d94c466305, https://si.imgix.net/f0da77a8/uploads/origins/ad208ee1-921b-4bd4-a836-511cd9faff2c?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=d770891dee099c0192120f1e2da6797e 2x, https://si.imgix.net/f0da77a8/uploads/origins/ad208ee1-921b-4bd4-a836-511cd9faff2c?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=f828a40ce5cf46f9b9d20472d7828451 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "Hello, I am a huge fan of your work! I love how you draw women! 🩷\n\nMy apologies for my first request, I totally get if this one isn't okay. Sorry and thank you for your time. 😖😣🙏  \nI am not sure if it is possible, but I would love for you to draw a feminine character with pink and long hair, with a fringe.  \nFor the outfit, I would love something J-fashion inspired, \" lovecore \" themed. Feminine clothes, frilly and cute! I love anything pink & red combo with lots of love & heart themed ! Like something Valentine's Day themed. Pink is my favourite colour, feel free to add lots of it ! \nFeel free to choose I love your artstyle so much !!\nFor the pose, feel free to choose it be it love themed or a warm, gentle pose. Feel free to choose 💞  If possible (if it is too much work, you do not have to! Only if possible, just the person is enough 💞) \nI would love if you could also draw my two bunnies Honey & Daisy even with cute accessories feel free to choose, even their poses) 🥰   \n\nFor the background, something simple & pink is enough 🫶 \n  I would love to use it as SNS icon and I would love to print it for myself, of course, so that I can stare at it everyday if allowed.   \n\nThank you for your work, and your time,  and sorry again it is my first time using skeb, I hope I am using it right this time!\n\nSending lots of love from France 🩷🤍🧡🐰\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/19Y42iG6hLL3E5cRsTlNSfKJ3Dc-Wmm5T", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@battan8/works/43", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/0609b379/uploads/origins/19af88d0-291a-4a0a-98c4-7ee0b2313e19?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=73936c5d61d22b10c1595331f4414db5", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/0609b379/uploads/origins/19af88d0-291a-4a0a-98c4-7ee0b2313e19?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=73936c5d61d22b10c1595331f4414db5, https://si.imgix.net/0609b379/uploads/origins/19af88d0-291a-4a0a-98c4-7ee0b2313e19?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=2aefebb313e4b624e2d2c819a9fa31b3 2x, https://si.imgix.net/0609b379/uploads/origins/19af88d0-291a-4a0a-98c4-7ee0b2313e19?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=f273794b0d45dca401dd304a2ce66663 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "ばったん先生お疲れ様です！プリースコです。\nリクエストを再開になられて嬉しくて、また先生にリクエストをさせて頂きたいと思います。\n今回はこの間先生に書いていただいたメグちゃんの彼女（？）的な存在、八重子（ヤエコ）ちゃんです。\n正反対の雰囲気があり、背が高く、スレンダーで凛とした女の子で、狐のような顔立ちをしながらシャイな性格があります。髪はサラサラした群青色のロングヘアで、眼は青色のつり目です。服はそれに合わせたオシャレなコーデを着ている姿です（先生の『ファタールゲーム』に登場する双海さんみたいなスタイルで）。\n構図やポーズに関してはメグちゃんの絵の反対向きにしていただきたいと思います。\n今回もお手数をおかけいたしますが、何卒よろしくお願いいたします。", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@battan8/works/42", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/e610fbcb/uploads/origins/46cf90d1-2e73-4283-8208-9ef70dbacd70?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=671a768064dc1e4da8eb4bbc2a2e0705", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/e610fbcb/uploads/origins/46cf90d1-2e73-4283-8208-9ef70dbacd70?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=671a768064dc1e4da8eb4bbc2a2e0705, https://si.imgix.net/e610fbcb/uploads/origins/46cf90d1-2e73-4283-8208-9ef70dbacd70?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=9db4fac63564f0aef0b04caef3e4e268 2x, https://si.imgix.net/e610fbcb/uploads/origins/46cf90d1-2e73-4283-8208-9ef70dbacd70?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=4c4cdc223359ce4e1707be4419749f21 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "battan先生、こんにちは！VtuberのY.A.Nです。\n\nリクエスト\n私のキャラクターを描いていただけませんか？表情、ポーズ、構図はお任せします！\n\nキャラクターについて\n未来から来たアンドロイドの女の子。\n\n特徴\n目はグラデーションパープル\nうさぎのような前歯\n髪はツインテールのロングヘア\n濃い青に紫のグラデーション。\n\nurlに参考文献を載せておきます。\n\nあなたの作品が大好きです！ご検討ありがとうございました！\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/12P5HyfkpztCbnYrQ3YwQzatydpFqIeCo", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@battan8/works/41", "thumbnail_src": "htt